ormat","target":"将你的梦之巨锤扔向远处，对沿途所有敌方单位造成 %d%% 武器伤害。在到达目标点后，梦之巨锤会飞回，可能再次对沿途目标造成伤害。\n\t\t学习此技能会增加梦之巨锤 %d 点命中。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a843c78b26b01b04f0bcab4e8579a6fc254c5553032f45a70fd0d21b65111360","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1661080ca73729601f32b6b288273674523f6445f5b2cfd0c36633a6745c0512","logical_entry_identity":"e6aab66f2eacf24829f6099b709f41040f43ecad00221b08c1404618651e6d72","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You absorb latent cold around you, turning into an ice elemental - a shivgoroth - for %d turns.\n\t\tWhile transformed, you do not need to breathe, gain access to the Ice Storm talent at level %d, gain %d%% resistance to cuts and stuns, gain %d%% cold resistance, and all cold damage heals you for %d%% of the damage done.\n\t\tThe power will increase with your Spellpower.\n\n\t\t#AQUAMARINE#Ice storm:#LAST#\n\t\t%s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你吸收周围的寒冰围绕你，将自己转变为纯粹的冰元素——西弗格罗斯，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t转化成元素后，你不需要呼吸并获得等级 %d 的冰雪风暴，获得 %d%% 震慑和流血抵抗，%d%% 寒冷伤害抗性。所有寒冷伤害可对你产生治疗，治疗量基于伤害值的 %d%%。\n\t\t效果受法术强度加成。\n\n\t\t#AQUAMARINE#冰雪风暴：#LAST#\n\t\t%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a11d3373f6824f277cbe061f50d884a47faa0117508e5460b30ba8a5e4084a0b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"22521cb0f447defd06897d00c18b18de5163b7276c98f949d4938a20159f266a","logical_entry_identity":"bf9a6a85b96df51afae32fd2dfdc36bd71f57883dfd6990bf5e9624c612356fa","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Briagh the Great Sand Wyrm. Where do you think Resonating Diamonds come from? They're just regular diamonds until they get stuck between Briagh's scales for a few centuries and get infused with his life rhythms. He sleeps on a hoard of precious gems and metals, you see.","source_tag":"_t","target":"布莱亚，那条巨型沙龙，要不然你认为共鸣钻石是哪里来的？它们原本只是普通的钻石，卡在布莱亚的鳞片间长达几个世纪，逐渐被灌注了生命节律。你看，它正是睡在一堆珍贵宝石和金属上呢。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d7b2774c460fcc8cec020bd169c38a547ecb5787af75ed7b09cdf34f48d3d316","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"267ed5a880f3643e548895e43c4240d3810362a3d6df2ffdc6f36c0ad69de322","logical_entry_identity":"4e6623df5d2130f102977ec28beb1c8759817427a5b6d2e6f3caa57c34c56b23","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"large chunk of wood","source_tag":"_t","target":"一大块木头"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"047894883a3b434989beabe322241a7613c5c68da07fba8a21c0890c48c14eb3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2af523f90600c0cf78ef42b95439761ae2ccad2c01a327f98f2ab62ae75e4282","logical_entry_identity":"0e277a90985c880ed2a5de6a21af112490f8d5552da445a2f77063d714486bae","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You focus on a target zone of radius 2 to make up to %d corrosive seeds appear.\n\t\tThe first seed will appear at the center of the target zone, while others will appear at random spots.\n\t\tEach seed lasts %d turns and will explode when a hostile creature walks over it, knocking the creature back and dealing %0.1f Acid damage within radius 1.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你集中精神于某块半径 2 的区域，制造至多 %d 个腐蚀之种。\n\t\t第一个种子会产生于中心处，其他的会随机出现。\n\t\t每个种子持续 %d 回合，当一个敌对生物走过腐蚀之种时，会在半径 1 的区域内引发一场爆炸，击退对方并造成 %0.1f 点酸性伤害。\n\t\t伤害受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f6f0cc25b06f1a2223024bd062584c11694cc3441c69cb46a38340ca2a099ddd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2b720778dccaf718f553947e7252ea6b78203ee38ba57bee81eacd30d693e121","logical_entry_identity":"75bc13035be068591a60898a702dfd145e6a349879df3849a7bcdb900ea6d64c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is wrapped in disorientating smoke, reducing vision range by %d.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标被令人迷失方向的烟雾包围，视野减少 %d。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a99bfd30d267af944119018501fc787b85ae2981f4f5a68b1890706791badff2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3b82c423215324e1989a019eb8d92a71c4ba228863dc660bd8d7b33f40ad0ad5","logical_entry_identity":"e6a094575555857ba90d47ffe6644a077f0c185b5e6fd03f24b3b5982b020df6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You notice the small things others do not notice, allowing you to \"see\" creatures in a %d radius even outside of light radius.\n\t\tThis is not telepathy, however, and it is still limited to line of sight.\n\t\tAlso, your attention to detail increases stealth detection and invisibility detection by %d, and you gain the ability to detect traps (+%d detect 'power').\n\t\tThe detection abilities improve with Cunning.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你注意到他人注意不到的细节，甚至能在阴影区域“看到”怪物，%d 码半径范围。\n\t\t注意此能力不属于心灵感应，仍然受到视野的限制。\n\t\t同时你的细致观察使你侦察潜行和隐身的能力增加 %d，使你发现周围的陷阱的能力增加 %d。\n\t\t上述侦测能力均受灵巧加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5af54a8a55bd7350fb3a30bdcd35db3cf8ecde625a972d7961fbac2dde83ed1a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"51dc1044ccd93828b787c3beb55728046cffc20c9314a8d2d57e38dc5f7da609","logical_entry_identity":"8700afd48e2a2b549cc62a39ce8627ca9675a84ab2c2b1031505002b6fa444c9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The Fortress Shadow said she could be cured.","source_tag":"_t","target":"堡垒之影说她有可能被治愈。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ce977ef0cdcb05a4fa91fb1cfaaf03397923eae49c4fc64a0a1d2941f703987c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5798fa7245c55cfbb66fa559e78c11064255d8cf11e0b894f36b675eee17e22a","logical_entry_identity":"4243ee60c9109c51039c8cb7288ed83e1cb5b4210d01918ac13b2d7671e6188f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Spikes of Decrepitude","source_tag":"talent name","target":"衰老尖刺"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d246d6f0e6400f3285a8f28dd76f7ce7baa021e66cb337030df78707266c7104","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5c633b44c4ce0f13805c9f22adb8463186bf83bc48499a9de363fbe3eb35dacd","logical_entry_identity":"d8b47c848399e29538a820377a645e09693c4fc53196de0f3d91a526e1d54c7e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The telekinetically-wielded weapon uses Willpower in place of Strength, and Cunning in place of Dexterity, to determine damage and Accuracy respectively.\n\t\t\tCombat stats:\n\t\t\tAccuracy: %d\n\t\t\tDamage: %d\n\t\t\tAPR: %d\n\t\t\tCrit: %0.2f\n\t\t\tSpeed: %0.2f","source_tag":"tformat","target":"念动武器使用意志和灵巧来分别代替力量和敏捷，以决定伤害和命中。\n\t\t\t战斗属性：\n\t\t\t命中：%d\n\t\t\t伤害：%d\n\t\t\t护甲穿透：%d\n\t\t\t暴击率：%0.2f\n\t\t\t速度：%0.2f"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aa64a37366f0539867ee9fe0bfeaaa5a2611ae6cb1ee43a4ded4d61e67e1f727","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"614b5112dcb4a22ddb02c4cea08630e840a9ca7b42811d3de6dbd88b868e2e5c","logical_entry_identity":"b8f874c6ca7ac44f18a887d040a7ac941dee21aadb40ebec427f1853081b8b72","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The telekinetically-wielded ranged weapon uses Willpower in place of Strength, and Cunning in place of Dexterity, to determine Accuracy and damage respectively.\n\t\t\tCombat stats:\n\t\t\tRange: %d\n\t\t\tAccuracy: %d\n\t\t\tDamage: %d\n\t\t\tAPR: %d\n\t\t\tCrit: %0.1f%%\n\t\t\tSpeed: %0.1f%%","source_tag":"tformat","target":"念动远程武器使用意志和灵巧来分别代替力量和敏捷，以决定命中和伤害。\n\t\t\t战斗属性：\n\t\t\t范围：%d\n\t\t\t命中：%d\n\t\t\t伤害：%d\n\t\t\t护甲穿透：%d\n\t\t\t暴击率：%0.1f%%\n\t\t\t攻击速度：%0.1f%%"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2200afd3862c67d64ba521a362a81947960f15e4586ba7ec75fe65186d745883","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6492930a9fe196e1a6db386cc3da8ab7b65c4028c067388e3546447b16eb71bc","logical_entry_identity":"2ba163595a007f6f0fe595096bf1ba26c13d8d75f5b36dce2f5cdc38b656a0e6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I have stared in the mouths of crimson wyrms\nAnd felt the claws of drakes so sleek\nBut through deserts dry and sandy storms\nThere is something else I seek\n\nIn the trail of giant worms I walk\nThrough tunnels of sand below\nOf arcane tools let there be no talk\nIt's on the wyrmic path I go!","source_tag":"_t","target":"我曾凝视赤红巨龙的巨口深处\n也曾领教矫健幼龙利爪\n可穿过干旱荒漠与沙暴\n我所追寻的另有其物\n\n我循着巨型沙龙的踪迹\n穿行在地下沙土隧道\n休要再提那些奥术器具\n我走的是龙战士之道！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"07ac4ccb7c9dc98ee3fd51033639bfc2592738e3ff6583791b3805fa8d28eb89","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6bb8440481d7478bace2a8519117be3e51cbd3b5faee71a369fd8ba9ff4d88fd","logical_entry_identity":"eca7705d97359b8736f0f58ac4f4a37503cd017c5cd618a0c37d189dfbe45fd8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A bulging rotten robe seems to tear at the seams, with masses of bloated worms spilling out all around the moving form.  Two arm-like appendages, each made up of overlapping mucous-drenched maggots, grasp tightly around the handles of bile-coated waraxes.\nEach swing drips pustulant fluid before it, and each droplet writhes and wriggles in the air before splashing against the ground.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一件鼓鼓囊囊的腐烂长袍似乎要从接缝处裂开，成团浮肿的蠕虫从这移动的躯体四周向外涌出。两只臂膀一样的附属物，每只都由沾满黏液的蛆重叠而成，各握着一柄覆有胆汁的战斧。\n每一次挥舞都会向前溅出脓液，每一滴脓液在空中扭动翻滚，然后啪嗒一声落在地上。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"afa4eba98c98a13be3a6e1d656b02ecdc23af5775361c0a4f1ecd39bb857bd2a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7c9fa38ef44d5ac2b06bbd8f53b5db664710f6f489191e1f0525da1f33bd1c02","logical_entry_identity":"80f9b3e3cf5d1cdffbfd7e993191f6e691749c311066eb08397fa249d04522a8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Spike of Decrepitude","source_tag":"_t","target":"衰老尖刺"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7dc43ac57b3fe8c41a805688559bc870482b6f450e0e832baeb3d28f44d7a54c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7e1edaef39d9c7e3e2036d45fb92828c6dde9d5deb67afa640c79e1e67011214","logical_entry_identity":"6ae7d9e93217b7a3e7ac086f4406b309b9600626ffaab2a11d093488b84a7b28","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Briagh, Great Sand Wyrm","source_tag":"entity name","target":"巨型沙龙布莱亚"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c11e81b02b81550288ea82ce5060213ac44cd558f47ed3006193836c9e5e2f13","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8cc0b0a2550cbb7e3ff0ef9b3589f5259df295024e3e9fb141bf35b35cf682cd","logical_entry_identity":"a0ea51dea126b7002060b021298b90ab6c7651934eab693ab18432ec721a7a18","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"conjure","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"幻化"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"934ceaab234080655ded6f38934c704cb19e2