s, if any.\n\t\tMindstars bonuses from damage and physical criticals: (+%d damage, +%d critical chance)","source_tag":"tformat","target":"以痛苦手势取代普通攻击，侵袭敌人的心智，造成 %0.1f 至 %0.1f 点精神伤害。若攻击成功，有 %d%% 几率使对手震慑 3 回合。\n\t\t这次打击会取代普通近战物理攻击，以你的精神强度对抗对手的精神豁免，因此不受你的命中或敌人闪避影响。发动攻击时，会计入所装备灵晶的双倍基础伤害及暴击几率。\n\t\t此技能要求两只手都可用于手势（每只手须为空手或装备灵晶），并有 25%% 几率施加思维封锁；攻击可以暴击。伤害随你的精神强度提高。\n\t\t若双手各装备一枚灵晶，攻击还会触发它们的附加效果（若有）。\n\t\t灵晶的伤害与物理暴击加成：（+%d 伤害，+%d 暴击几率）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"74f5e164ebde6cfcd01eab1d7c1f82311e5881db2533717595f2ebafb35fda5b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a70579f16645c1f04b1dc99a2cccae3aca2131c509442f47d12caf29484b9d49","logical_entry_identity":"5dd08c00b6e6dd44040c455f332cc7e014c0b3756d0028aab99368468a773e4b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" #ffcc80#, -%d stam#LAST#","source_tag":"tformat","target":" #ffcc80#, -%d 体力#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"690a350bf92fa2a85837a01a63c3f05222ec6352eafcb72a80ef64b28396540d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a708a19361df2f4d80e80650810d40180b146772a522ad7a2d044e258f992033","logical_entry_identity":"49c2a7b83046e3b59f334951c263920043e6122ab911443951269b01994408b0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You cannot unlearn this talent!","source_tag":"_t","target":"你不能遗忘这个技能！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"77830bd69ba863dcfc84367c0fbac3ac8ea3df073f345dcc6ef4a62847e0852f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a708eebd8f438c047cba7cb881b19989a4fe7be24782928ad752536fb160646e","logical_entry_identity":"ff4e067cf6f72943557b0ecd03b6ac3390608cbbd028c1853f299977aea4e7eb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Source# shoves #Target# aside.","source_tag":"logCombat","target":"#Source#击退了#Target#。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"bf27c7e7d839cafa0a15d65b7933c68e80287e87c3b833fb14755fde1d76